/A 2072 0 R
/Alt (Infographic illustrating the role of artificial intelligence in drug discovery, divided into sections on molecular representation, applications across the drug discovery pipeline, and advanced methodological strategies. Molecular representation includes string-based, graph-based, and geometric representations, with visual diagrams of molecular graphs and structures. The pipeline applications are shown with flowcharts detailing deep learning models for DTI, DTA prediction, de novo molecule design, optimization, ADME, toxicity, and PK prediction. The bottom section highlights strategies such as addressing data scarcity, novel drug modalities, multimodal fusion, and explainable AI. Purple headings and arrows organize the concepts.)
